KONOHA NINJA ACADEMY
New Student Guide

Welcome to the Ninja Academy. The Academy is the foundation of every Leaf shinobi's career, where civilian and clan children alike train from roughly age six until graduation.

Curriculum overview:
- Chakra theory and the hand seals (the twelve zodiac seals)
- The Academy Three: Transformation, Clone, and Substitution Jutsu
- Shuriken and kunai accuracy (target practice range, west wing)
- Taijutsu fundamentals and sparring etiquette
- History of the village and the Will of Fire

Graduation requires passing the written examination and a practical jutsu demonstration before an Academy instructor (traditionally the Clone Jutsu). Successful students receive a Konoha forehead protector and are assigned to a genin squad.

Instructor of record: Iruka Umino, Chunin.
Classes convene at the Academy each morning. Tardiness is logged. Respect your instructors and your classmates.
